  "text": "I've been there. Certificates on the wall and treating acne clients one appointment at a time. Education tells you what acne is, but it doesn't tell you how to-- doesn't tell you how to turn it into a program that clients will book, pay for, and finish. And the gap between knowing and doing is where most skin specialists do get stuck. This is exactly why I created the Clear Code protocol. I created the templates, the scripts, and the structure to be able to use what you know. You can confidently plan it, launch it, and nurture it. Education will get you started, and the implementation will get you results. Our doors open on Black Friday, so join our wait list. The link is in our bio.",
